{"text": "Perhaps I will fall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Right through the earth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She said to herself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then I will meet the people. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who walk with their heads downward. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She would ask them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Please, Madam. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Is this New Zealand or Australia. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She even tried to curtsey. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> While she was falling through the air. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There was nothing else to do so Alice soon began talking again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Dinah will miss me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Very much tonight. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Alice. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Dinah was the cat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That Alice had left at home. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I hope. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They will remember her saucer of milk. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At teatime. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> There are no mice in the air. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But a bat is very much like a mouse. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But do cats eat bats. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She wondered sleepily. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She began to dream. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That she was walking. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Hand in hand with Dinah. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then, thump, thump. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Alice landed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On a heap of sticks and dry leaves.", "alignment": {"characters": ["P", "e", "r", "h", "a", "p", "s", " ", "I", " ", "w", "i", "l", "l", " ", "f", "a", "l", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "R", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "t", "h", "r", "o", "u", "g", "h", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "e", "a", "r", "t", "h", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "h", "e", "r", "s", "e", "l", "f", 